{"title": "Morphic Ambush (passive feature)", "pageid": 30370, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Morphic_Ambush_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Threat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp/300px-Generic_Threat.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp/300px-Generic_Threat.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Morphic Ambush</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">Dolor</a>, which gives him automatic critical hits against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ambushed_(Condition)\" title=\"Ambushed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ambushed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ambushed_(Condition)\" title=\"Ambushed (Condition)\">Ambushed</a> enemies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Any successful <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> against a creature that has been Ambushed by a <a href=\"/wiki/Doppelganger\" title=\"Doppelganger\">Doppelganger</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715045116\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 707/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3585/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1983/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 73/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643782/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.913      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.913      1 -total\n 61.30%   18.949      1 Template:PageSeo\n 60.33%   18.651      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 47.05%   14.545      1 Template:Cond\n 30.57%    9.450      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 29.24%    9.039      1 Template:Icon_link\n 27.98%    8.648      1 Template:Icon_text\n 24.42%    7.549      2 Template:Trim\n 21.36%    6.603      1 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30370-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715045116 and revision id 178974. Rendering was triggered be